  "caseId": "case05",
  "description": "The end-of-file write triple, exactly three records and no fourth. :202 performs 1110-WRITE-PAGE-TOTALS, which writes REPORT-PAGE-TOTALS and then a TRANSACTION-HEADER-2 rule and advances WS-LINE-COUNTER once for each; :203 performs 1110-WRITE-GRAND-TOTALS (:318-322), which writes REPORT-GRAND-TOTALS and advances the counter NOT AT ALL - it is the only write paragraph in the program with no ADD 1 TO WS-LINE-COUNTER. The absence is invisible in the report because the grand total is always the last record written, and this case pins that fact from the other side: no rule line follows the grand total and nothing else is written after it.",
